==Icelandic==

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|þýddi|þýtt}}

# {{context|transitive|takes the accusative}} to [[translate]] a language{{jump|is|translate|s}}
#: ''Geturðu '''þýtt''' þetta?''
#:: Can you '''translate''' this?
#: ''Gætirðu '''þýtt''' þetta fyrir mig?''
#:: Could you '''translate''' this for me?
#: ''Hvernig '''þýðirðu''' þetta orð?''
#:: How do you '''translate''' this word?

